  "solution": {
    "text": "The given gate is a NOR gate. The output is high, when all inputs are low.\nTruth Table:\n\\begin{tabular}{|c|c|c|}\n\\hline $\\mathbf{A}$ & $\\mathbf{B}$ & $\\mathbf{Y}$ \\\\\n\\hline 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n\\hline 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n\\hline 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n\\hline 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n\\hline \\multicolumn{2}{|c|} { Logic Symbols } \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{tabular}\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/SAl1pjY7HKepM_U07OxoNd3okXgOIZ1vojjvHw6KR7A.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nBoolean expression: $\\overline{\\mathrm{A}+\\mathrm{B}}=\\mathrm{Y}$",
